<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-17T22:29:52.914Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:29:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue in Narathiwat, where police officers and insurgents have been killed in multiple gun battles, and a policeman was killed on National Police Day. A pipe bomb in Yala wounded five army officers and a separate bomb injured five security volunteers, while an air hostess is linked to a ring smuggling Chinese nationals across the Thai-Malaysian border. Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet and Thai officials are exchanging accusations over a border dispute, and a cross-border fiber-optic cable was discovered linking a house to a Myanmar casino operation. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/lifestyle-culture/article/3371180/shunned-west-ye-hands-indonesia-rare-mega-tour-coup?utm_source=rss_feed&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPdGEzeVVxNkg0UDFQd0lZNE9PX1pNYk8wNElhZ2xldWExZ3RrOEdkc3Z3bnhUU3FJX1A5TUhiTnBfRmVWZXlUVlJsRDJvZjZzNXFDaFhmS0NIckhWMmtMVWF6R0NaeU9uXzBZOEVvckt4TlRXZzI4Tm5oVDBXNFpuUExwNDdNbGpnMk5zR0dlazlhOVh0TURTejI4aVZMejBvQXNCWFU2OUhzWWZGaS1OUzNHWWZGUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Malaysia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai Examiner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOdlBKMk1oT2ItbF9Mc2UtelNJYUZtTUR6RmdvVG0zZ2dlUVpyb0JDdmV3bmk4b3lPbnZRZTdGSUxCaWVxaGlOV3FydVk2VGRfejhlWXhrOVREdTJDVDNaYjhTeGZIWkt1b19zM2VhNVVsY2VpdGlrQ0ZEdlZpdzZ6eDJlU3h4NW02amR4QmNTMTNpRjg5SGxMUGxOSXZjTUhJY3FLdmhZUkZ3NXBI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu